    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>1. COURSE GRADING ELEMENTS： (1) Literature Review (Critical Analysis) (Midterm presentation) - Oral Presentation + Paper Report 40% (2) Final Project (Thesis Proposal)(Final presentation) - Oral Presentation + Paper Report 40% (3) Attendance, Participation and Homework of Information Literacy 20% 2. Literature Review (Critical Analysis)： Literature review is an important part of a Master&#39;s thesis. Each student has to submit a written paper prior to the due day, and prepares an oral presentation as well. The guidelines for the written paper will be attached in the &quot;Course Document&quot; section. 3. Final Paper： Each student has to submit a written paper prior to the last week of this class. An oral presentation is also required. The objective is to help students compose their thesis proposals ahead of the school schedule. The guidelines for the written paper will be attached in the &quot;Course Document&quot; section. 4. Attendance and Participation： Class participation and discussion, including responses to the Discussion Board, are highly recommend. Students who can not attend a certain class should inform the instructor prior to the scheduled class. However, too much absence may affect the grade of this course.</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "1.依規定時間上、下課，不得無故缺課或遲到早退。\n2.課程進行中，應將行動電話關機或改為震動，避免影響教學與他人學習。\n3.應保有包容性，並相互尊重，進行有效的學習。",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": "1.請依每週課程主題，提前參閱所提供的閱讀教材。\n2.本課程將成立LINE群組，俾使課程資料、講義及訊息之傳送。\n3.如有課程上疑問，請利用請益時間或email詢問。",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>在學術上應秉持正直、誠實、客觀，落實負責任的研究行為，保有原創性，若有引用他人或其他訊息，必須加上註解，並遵守相關之法令及學術倫理行規範，不做出任何影響個人前途以及學校聲譽之不當行為，若違法，將依本校學生獎懲辦法提報處分。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
